# ─── LIVE-DB TEST PROJECT settings (apps/api/.env.test) ─────────────────────────
# Copy to apps/api/.env.test (git-ignored) and fill from the dedicated TEST Supabase
# project: Dashboard > Connect. NEVER put the production project here: the live
# suites create and delete rows, and a loader guard refuses protected project refs.
# Setup guide: docs/test-database.md
#
# DATABASE_URL  The `campass_app` role (NOSUPERUSER NOBYPASSRLS, created by
#               packages/db/test-project/001-create-app-role.sql) over the
#               TRANSACTION pooler (port 6543). ?pgbouncer=true is REQUIRED.
#               Supavisor login username format: campass_app.<test-project-ref>
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://campass_app.<test-project-ref>:<campass_app-password>@aws-0-<region>.pooler.supabase.com:6543/postgres?pgbouncer=true"

# Optional: only for the real-storage smoke suite (storage.smoke.integration.test.ts),
# which is skipped when these are absent. Use the TEST project's URL and
# service-role key, and create a `documents` bucket there first.
# SUPABASE_URL="https://<test-project-ref>.supabase.co"
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY="<test-project-service-role-key>"
# SUPABASE_STORAGE_BUCKET="documents"
